# Kite draft worktrees — nested linked worktrees under the org tree.
# Excluded so a future unscoped `git add`/`git status .` at the org root
# never walks or stages another draft's checkout (footgun-prevention; see
# draft latency plan Increment 0).
.worktrees/

# OpenCode/agent harness config. ``.opencode/agents/coding.md`` embeds the
# coding agent's system prompt; it is written into the sandbox at runtime and
# left in place between runs (overwritten each run). Ignored here so an
# unscoped, whole-tree stage on the sandbox can never commit it — the system
# prompt stays out of git history (EXCLUDE_PATTERNS already keeps it out of
# EFS sync).
.opencode/
